  "inputs": "offered_start: the caller's exact future absolute time.monotonic() start (never retimed); deadline: the caller's ORIGINAL absolute time.monotonic() deadline; cleanup_reserve_s >= 0 kept free after the drain deadline; clock_domain must equal the envelope clock_domain (nominal_client.clock_domain())",
